Adaptation notice
=================

Better TypeScript consolidates and rewrites guidance from these MIT-licensed skills:

- Lauren Tan (poteto), TypeScript best practices:
  https://github.com/backnotprop/pstack/tree/main/skills/typescript-best-practices
- Matteo Collina, TypeScript magician:
  https://github.com/mcollina/skills/tree/main/skills/typescript-magician
- Seth Hobson, TypeScript advanced types:
  https://github.com/wshobson/agents/tree/main/plugins/javascript-typescript/skills/typescript-advanced-types

This is a curated adaptation, not a complete upstream import. Supporting rules and
examples are consolidated into focused references; examples are rewritten and
corrected. Broad orchestration and global enforcement are omitted in favor of the
target project's conventions, compiler, runtime, and existing tools.

Matt Pocock's articles and official documentation are linked alongside synthesized
guidance; they are not bundled or covered by the upstream licenses below.

